I was fiddling around in Wizard mode yesterday, and was wondering just
what extent the bag of holding abuse could be taken to.  Well, quite an
extent was the answer.  I wished for 32767 loadstones (on your system,
you may have larger integers and could get 2 millions some odd
loadstones), and did the mumbo jumbo I'm sure most people are familiar
with.  Well, after this, I could just walk up to boulders (you know, the
"squeezing in" bit), and pick them up and walk around with them.  Sort
of amusing.  I picked up six (I didn't feel like working up more) with
no problem, and could go up and down stairs and everything.  Now, all
that has to happen is make a ton of loadstones appear in normal mode. 
Does anybody know if you could polypile a bunch of cursed rocks and make
them loadstones?

By the way, Nethack++ is pretty cool, so far.  It's kind of odd to be
encountering dingos and maggots as well as newts and jackals on the
first few levels.  And the new classes are pretty damn amusing too.

